  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Fish_Types?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/62/Roach.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711152953\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/62/Roach.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20150711152953\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"172\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Fish</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Fish</b> can be lured or caught in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Lake</a>, either using <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nets</a>, they are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27.\n</p><p>All but <a href=\"/wiki/carp-11437\" title=\"Carp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Carps</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/giant-barb-11060\" title=\"Giant Barb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Giant Barbs</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/lake-sturgeon-11059\" title=\"Lake Sturgeon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lake Sturgeons</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/nile-perch-11452\" title=\"Nile Perch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nile Perches</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/red-tailed-catfish-11453\" title=\"Red-Tailed Catfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Red-Tailed Catfish</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/zander-11028\" title=\"Zander\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Zanders</a> can be caught in any times but in specific areas.\n</p><p>There are a total of 43 kinds of fish.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Catching and luring fish</b></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish</a> can be lured by <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Red Lures, Green Lures, Blue Lures, Purple Lures and Gold Lures</a>, and be caught by <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-net-16888\" title=\"Fishing Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Nets</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-net-16940\" title=\"Mystery Net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery Nets</a>.\n</p><p><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/96/Red_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225706\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red Lure\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/96/Red_Lure.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20140330225706\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Green_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225800\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Lure\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Green_Lure.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20140330225800\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/12/Blue_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225859\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/17/Purple_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a8/Gold_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330230009\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gold Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a1/Fishing_Net.png/revision/latest?cb=20150725033019\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fishing Net\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/17/Mystery_Net.png/revision/latest?cb=20150725033113\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mystery Net\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Rewards of luring and catching a fish</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Using <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a> to lure <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a> or using <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nets</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Lake</a> can result to get a fish fillet.</li>\n<li>If you <b>lured</b> a new fish with <b>lures</b>, or get a same fish with the different rewards (bronze, silver or gold), you can get diamonds<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li>\n<li>Luring a new fish is one of the best ways to earn diamonds<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fd/BronzeFish.png/revision/latest?cb=20140321154032\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"BronzeFish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d0/SilverFish.png/revision/latest?cb=20140321154102\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"SilverFish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/GoldFish.png/revision/latest?cb=20140321154048\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"GoldFish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/60/FishingMap_Names.png/revision/latest?cb=20180725200602\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"FishingMap Names\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"331\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Types of Fish</b></span></h3>\n<pre>Note: For more details, see <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fish</a>\n</pre>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/copper-redhorse-10101\" title=\"Copper Redhorse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Copper Redhorse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/roach-10292\" title=\"Roach\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roach\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/coho-salmon-10639\" title=\"Coho Salmon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coho Salmon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/yellow-perch-10651\" title=\"Yellow Perch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Yellow Perch\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/fallfish-10652\" title=\"Fallfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fallfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/salmon-10653\" title=\"Salmon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Salmon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/copper-redhorse-10101\" title=\"Copper Redhorse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Copper Redhorse</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/roach-10292\" title=\"Roach\" rel=\"