bluespotted-sunfish-10864\" title=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/bitterling-10865\" title=\"Bitterling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bitterling\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/asp-10866\" title=\"Asp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Asp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/speckled-dace-11255\" title=\"Speckled Dace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Speckled Dace\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bluegill-10654\" title=\"Bluegill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bluegill</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/rainbowfish-10863\" title=\"Rainbowfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rainbowfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bluespotted-sunfish-10864\" title=\"Bluespotted Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bluespotted Sunfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bitterling-10865\" title=\"Bitterling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bitterling</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/asp-10866\" title=\"Asp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Asp</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/speckled-dace-11255\" title=\"Speckled Dace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Speckled Dace</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Spot</a> 2\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/fish