  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Roach.png|200px|left|Fish]]\n'''Fish''' can be lured or caught in the [[Fishing Lake]], either using [[Lure|lures]] or [[Net Maker|nets]], they are unlocked at [[Experience|experience]] level 27.\n\nAll but [[Carp]]s, [[Giant Barb]]s, [[Lake Sturgeon]]s, [[Nile Perch]]es, [[Red-Tailed Catfish]] and [[Zander]]s can be caught in any times but in specific areas.\n\nThere are a total of 43 kinds of fish.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Catching and luring fish'''===\n[[Fish]] can be lured by [[Lure|Red Lures, Green Lures, Blue Lures, Purple Lures and Gold Lures]], and be caught by [[Fishing Net]]s and [[Mystery Net]]s.\n\n[[File:Red Lure.png|75px]]\n[[File:Green Lure.png|75px]]\n[[File:Blue Lure.png|75px]]\n[[File:Purple Lure.png|75px]]\n[[File:Gold Lure.png|75px]]\n[[File:Fishing Net.png|125px]]\n[[File:Mystery Net.png|125px]]\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Rewards of luring and catching a fish'''===\n*Using [[Lure|lures]] to lure [[Fish|fish]] or using [[Net Maker|nets]] in the [[Fishing Lake]] can result to get a fish fillet.\n*If you '''lured''' a new fish with '''lures''', or get a same fish with the different rewards (bronze, silver or gold), you can get diamonds{{Infoicon|dia}}.\n*Luring a new fish is one of the best ways to earn diamonds{{Infoicon|dia}}.\n[[File:BronzeFish.png]]\n[[File:SilverFish.png]]\n[[File:GoldFish.png]]\n{{Clr}}----\n[[File:FishingMap Names.png|500px|centre]]\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Types of Fish'''===\n Note: For more details, see [[Fish]]\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em auto; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ccc;\"\n|- style=\"background: #ddd;\"\n|[[File:Copper Redhorse.png|75px|link=Copper Redhorse]]\n|[[File:Roach.png|75px|link=Roach]]\n|[[File:Coho Salmon.png|75px|link=Coho Salmon]]\n|[[File:Yellow Perch.png|75px|link=Yellow Perch]]\n|[[File:Fallfish.png|75px|link=Fallfish]]\n|[[File:Salmon.png|75px|link=Salmon]]\n|- style=\"background: #ddd;\"\n|'''[[Copper Redhorse]]'''\n|'''[[Roach]]'''\n|'''[[Coho Salmon]]'''\n|'''[[Yellow Perch]]'''\n|'''[[Fallfish]]'''\n|'''[[Salmon]]'''\n|- style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 1\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 1\n|[[Fishing Lake|'''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">Spot</span>''']] '''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">2</span>'''\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 7\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 7\n|[[Fishing Lake|'''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">Spot</span>''']] '''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">8</span>'''\n|- style=\"background: #ddd;\"\n|[[File:Bluegill.png|75px|link=Bluegill]]\n|[[File:Rainbowfish.png|75px|link=Rainbowfish]]\n|[[File:Bluespotted Sunfish.png|75px|link=Bluespotted Sunfish]]\n|[[File:Bitterling.png|75px|link=Bitterling]]\n|[[File:Asp.png|75px|link=Asp]]\n|[[File:Speckled Dace.png|75px|link=Speckled Dace]]\n|- style=\"background: #ddd;\"\n|'''[[Bluegill]]'''\n|'''[[Rainbowfish]]'''\n|'''[[Bluespotted Sunfish]]'''\n|'''[[Bitterling]]'''\n|'''[[Asp]]'''\n|'''[[Speckled Dace]]'''\n|- style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 2\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 8\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 3\n|[[Fishing Lake|'''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">Spot</span>''']] '''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">6</span>'''\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 8\n|[[Fishing Lake|'''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">Spot</span>''']] '''<span style=\"color: #2F01AA;\">6</span>'''\n|- style=\"background: #ddd;\"\n|[[File:Huchen.png|75px|link=Huchen]]\n|[[File:Shadow Bass.png|75px|link=Shadow Bass]]\n|[[File:Northern Pike.png|75px|link=Northern Pike]]\n|[[File:Rainbow Smelt.png|75px|link=Rainbow Smelt]]\n|[[File:Spotted Sunfish.png|75px|link=Spotted Sunfish]]\n|[[File:Sauger.png|75px|link=Sauger]]\n|- style=\"background: #ddd;\"\n|'''[[Huchen]]'''\n|'''[[Shadow Bass]]'''\n|'''[[Northern Pike]]'''\n|'''[[Rainbow Smelt]]'''\n|'''[[Spotted Sunfish]]'''\n|'''[[Sauger]]'''\n|- style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 8\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 1\n|[[Fishing Lake|Spot]] 8\n|[[Fish